  "limitations": [
    "This is a sparse single-house research panel, not an exhaustive multi-house poll average.",
    "Fixed cutoffs select the latest available national Camera vote-intention table from the reviewed Demos Atlante reports; stale observations retain their real dates.",
    "Every observation asks about Camera voting. European targets intentionally use Camera intentions as a cross-kind predictor; none is relabelled as a European-ballot poll.",
    "Full interview sample sizes are reported for provenance; the decided-voter question sample sizes are unknown.",
    "Other aggregates all parties outside PD, M5S and Lega and cannot support party-level FdI/FI/AVS conclusions.",
    "Terminal 15-day observations belong to the existing government historical archive and are not reproduced as early-horizon inputs here."
